+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+This project's recorded decision is that TLS certificate verification must be enforced on all builds, including development builds. An earlier workaround that disabled certificate verification for development builds was explicitly retired in favor of this requirement, and no subsequent record reinstates a development-build exception.
